OL,3,GNEWSAMental health wards told to
OL,4,Aimprove upgraded to 'good'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hospital, run by Affinity
OL,7,FHealthcare Limited, provides a range of
OL,8,Finpatient mental health services for
OL,9,Fyoung people between 11-17 and adults.
OL,10,FThe inspection followed the receipt of
OL,11,Finformation of concern, the CQC said.
OL,13,FCQC inspectors found the hospital had
OL,14,Fmade necessary improvements and was now
OL,15,Fonly in breach of one regulation
OL,16,Frelated to safe care and treatment.
